ss-system slurs, or to specify the shape of very complex slurs."}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlslur","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLSlur","title":"MXLSlur","kind":"symbol"}}}